# The menu bar and the toolbars: what ships, what greys when, arranging them, the Menus and
# toolbars settings page, and saving and recalling an arrangement.
#
# A dropdown is never opened — it is a popup with a window of its own — so `menu main <Menu>`
# renders the rows a click would show. Alt and F10 are not exercised: a run posts no input.

tree .
refresh

# --- What ships ---

assert-bars default
assert-menu-bar File | Edit | View | Go | Tools | Help
assert-toolbar title edit.undo edit.redo - tools.disk-usage tools.duplicates tools.changes tools.compare app.settings
assert-hidden ToolbarRows
shot 01-default TitleBarRoot

# Nothing has been done, so there is nothing to undo; the rest of the toolbar is live.
assert-toolbar-item title edit.undo disabled
assert-toolbar-item title tools.disk-usage enabled
assert-toolbar-item title tools.compare unchecked

menu main File
assert-menu-item New tab
assert-menu-item Folder
assert-menu-item Exit
assert-menu-order New tab | New | - | Open | Run as administrator | Open in | - | Rename
assert-menu-gesture New tab Ctrl+T
# A list with nothing in it and no empty-state line takes its submenu with it.
assert-no-menu-item Your commands

menu main Edit
assert-menu-order Undo | Redo | Undo history | - | Cut | Copy | Paste
assert-menu-gesture Cut Ctrl+X

menu main View
assert-menu-item Sort by
assert-menu-item Date modified
assert-menu-item Preview pane
assert-menu-item Menus and toolbars
assert-menu-item No saved arrangements
assert-menu-item No saved workspaces

menu main Go
assert-menu-order Back | Forward | Up | Drive root | - | Edit address
assert-menu-item Drives

menu main Tools
assert-menu-item Find duplicates
assert-menu-item Transfers

menu main Help
assert-menu-order Command palette | Search syntax help | - | About BertBrowser
dialog about

# --- A menu says what the selection makes of a command ---

select notes.txt, report.md
menu main File selected
assert-menu-item Rename 2 items
assert-menu-item Delete 2 items
deselect

# --- The toolbar follows what the app is doing ---

select photo.jpg
move to Documents
assert-toolbar-item title edit.undo enabled
undo
assert-toolbar-item title edit.undo disabled
deselect

# Two folders side by side, neither inside the other, or the comparison is refused.
go Documents
split right Pictures
compare
assert-toolbar-item title tools.compare checked
compare-end
assert-toolbar-item title tools.compare unchecked
closepane
go .

# --- Arranging by hand ---

command-bars toolbar title nav.back nav.up - view.preview view.hidden custom:gone @workspaces
assert-bars custom
# The command nothing answers to is kept in the arrangement and simply not shown.
assert-toolbar title nav.back nav.up - view.preview view.hidden @workspaces
assert-toolbar-item title view.preview unchecked
preview on
assert-toolbar-item title view.preview checked
preview off
shot 02-custom-toolbar TitleBarRoot

command-bars toolbar row1 text tab.new pane.split-right - file.rename
assert-visible ToolbarRows
assert-toolbar row1 tab.new pane.split-right - file.rename
assert-toolbar-item row1 tab.new text
assert-toolbar-item title nav.back icon
# Rename needs a selection.
assert-toolbar-item row1 file.rename disabled
select notes.txt
assert-toolbar-item row1 file.rename enabled
deselect
shot 03-toolbar-row

command-bars menu Mine tab.new - @drives
assert-menu-bar File | Edit | View | Go | Tools | Help | Mine
menu main Mine
assert-menu-order New tab | -

# --- Saving and recalling ---

command-bars save Work
assert-bars Work
menu main View with-saved
assert-menu-item Work
assert-no-menu-item No saved arrangements

command-bars reset
assert-bars default
assert-hidden ToolbarRows
assert-menu-bar File | Edit | View | Go | Tools | Help

command-bars apply Work
assert-bars Work
assert-visible ToolbarRows
assert-toolbar title nav.back nav.up - view.preview view.hidden @workspaces

command-bars rename Work to Daily
assert-bars Daily
command-bars saved
palette open
palette type daily
assert-palette-row Daily
palette close

# --- Settings open: the folders' commands grey, the app's own do not ---

command-bars reset
settings command-bars
assert-toolbar-item title tools.disk-usage disabled
assert-toolbar-item title app.settings enabled
shot 04-settings-page

menu main File under-settings
assert-menu-item New tab

# The page starts on the menu bar, which holds menus.
assert-bar-rows File | Edit | View | Go | Tools | Help
settings bars open Help
assert-bar-rows Command palette | Search syntax help | - | About BertBrowser
# Dragged: a row to a new place and back, and a choice dropped exactly between two rows.
list-drag BarRows 2 Command palette
assert-bar-rows Search syntax help | Command palette | - | About BertBrowser
list-drag BarRows 0 Command palette
assert-bar-rows Command palette | Search syntax help | - | About BertBrowser
settings bars filter refresh
list-drag BarChoices>BarRows 1 Refresh
assert-bar-rows Command palette | Refresh | Search syntax help | - | About BertBrowser
settings bars remove Refresh
settings bars filter
assert-bar-rows Command palette | Search syntax help | - | About BertBrowser
settings bars pick Search syntax help
settings bars add nav.refresh
assert-bar-rows Command palette | Search syntax help | Refresh | - | About BertBrowser
settings bars nudge Refresh up
assert-bar-rows Command palette | Refresh | Search syntax help | - | About BertBrowser
settings bars name Reload
assert-bar-rows Command palette | Reload | Search syntax help | - | About BertBrowser
assert-bars custom
menu main Help edited
assert-menu-order Command palette | Reload | Search syntax help
shot 05-editing-help

settings bars remove Reload
settings bars up
assert-bar-rows File | Edit | View | Go | Tools | Help
assert-bars default

# A new menu, renamed and filled.
settings bars pick Help
settings bars add-menu
settings bars name &Window
assert-bar-rows File | Edit | View | Go | Tools | Help | Window
assert-menu-bar File | Edit | View | Go | Tools | Help | Window
settings bars open Window
settings bars add pane.swap
settings bars add @drives
assert-bar-rows Swap panes | Drives
settings bars up

# The picker narrows by name, and can show only what is nowhere yet.
settings bars filter thumbnail
assert-bar-choice Thumbnail view
assert-no-bar-choice New tab
settings bars filter
settings bars unplaced on
assert-bar-choice Go to tab 1
assert-no-bar-choice New tab
settings bars unplaced off

# A toolbar, edited the same way.
settings bars select title
assert-bar-rows Undo | Redo | - | Analyse disk usage | Find duplicates | What changed here | Compare with other pane | Settings
settings bars remove Find duplicates
assert-toolbar title edit.undo edit.redo - tools.disk-usage tools.changes tools.compare app.settings
shot 06-editing-toolbar

command-bars save Trimmed
settings command-bars
shot 07-saved-list
dialog saved-command-bars

# Save as and Rename on the page itself: a name box in place of a dialog.
press BarSaveAs
field-type BarSaveName Evening
press BarSaveCommit
assert-bars Evening
press BarRenameSaved
field-type BarSaveName Night
press BarSaveCommit
assert-bars Night
shot 07b-saved-renamed

command-bars reset
assert-bars default
settings close

# --- A narrow window: the toolbar gives way before the search box does ---

command-bars toolbar title edit.undo edit.redo - tools.disk-usage tools.duplicates tools.changes tools.compare app.settings nav.back nav.forward nav.up nav.refresh view.preview view.metadata view.flat view.hidden tab.new tab.close pane.split-right pane.split-below
shot 08-crowded TitleBarRoot
command-bars reset
